msgid "Gradle builds for Android"
msgstr "適用於 Android 的 Gradle 建置"

msgid ""
"Godot provides the option to build using the `Gradle <https://gradle.org/"
">`__ build system. Instead of using the pre-built template, an Android "
"template project gets installed into your project folder. Godot will then "
"build it and use it as an export template every time you export the project."
msgstr ""
"Godot 提供使用 `Gradle <https://gradle.org/>`__ 建置系統的選項。它不使用預先"
"編譯的範本，而是將 Android 範本專案安裝到你的專案資料夾中。之後每次匯出專案"
"時，Godot 都會建置該範本，並將其作為匯出範本。"

msgid "There are some reasons why you may want to do this:"
msgstr "有幾個原因會需要這麼做："

msgid "Export an AAB binary for Google Play."
msgstr "匯出供 Google Play 使用的 AAB 二進位檔。"

msgid ""
"Export an AAR binary that can be :ref:`embedded within an Android "
"application <doc_embedding_in_android_projects>`."
msgstr ""
"匯出可 :ref:`嵌入 Android 應用程式 <doc_embedding_in_android_projects>` 的 "
"AAR 二進位檔。"

msgid ""
"Modify and customize the Android template project used to export the project."
msgstr "修改及自訂用來匯出專案的 Android 範本專案。"

msgid ""
"Add Android / Java / Kotlin SDKs and libraries that build with your project."
msgstr "新增與專案一起建置的 Android／Java／Kotlin SDK 與函式庫。"

msgid ""
"The native portion of the template (the ``.so`` library included in the "
"exported binary) remains precompiled. This means that unlike :ref:`compiling "
"a custom Android export template <doc_compiling_for_android>`, you don't "
"need to install a C++ toolchain or clone the Godot source code."
msgstr ""
"範本中的原生程式部分（匯出二進位檔內的 ``.so`` 函式庫）仍是預先編譯的。這表示"
"與 :ref:`編譯自訂 Android 匯出範本 <doc_compiling_for_android>` 不同，你不需"
"要安裝 C++ 工具鏈或複製 Godot 原始碼。"

msgid ""
"Configuring the Gradle build is a fairly straightforward process. But first, "
"you need to follow the steps in :ref:`exporting for android "
"<doc_exporting_for_android>` up to :ref:`Setting it up in Godot "
"<doc_exporting_for_android_setting_it_up_in_godot>`. After doing that, "
"follow the steps below."
msgstr ""
"設定 Gradle 建置的流程相當簡單，但請先依照 :ref:`匯出至 Android "
"<doc_exporting_for_android>` 的步驟，操作到 :ref:`在 Godot 中設定 "
"<doc_exporting_for_android_setting_it_up_in_godot>`。完成後，再依下列步驟操"
"作。"

msgid "Set up the Gradle build environment"
msgstr "設定 Gradle 建置環境"

msgid "Go to the Project menu, and select :menu:`Setup Android Build...`:"
msgstr "前往 Project 選單，選擇 :menu:`Setup Android Build...`："

msgid ""
"Make sure export templates are downloaded. If not, this menu will help you "
"download them."
msgstr "請確定有下載匯出樣板。若沒下載的話，該選單會協助下載。"

msgid ""
"A Gradle-based Android project will be created under ``res://android/"
"build``. Editing these files is not needed unless you really need to modify "
"the project."
msgstr ""
"這會在 ``res://android/build`` 下建立一個 Gradle 為基礎的 Android 專案。除非"
"你真的需要修改專案，否則不需要編輯這些檔案。"

msgid "Performing Gradle builds from the Android editor"
msgstr "在 Android 編輯器中執行 Gradle 建置"

msgid ""
"Since Godot 4.6, it is possible to perform Gradle builds from the Android "
"editor. This requires installing the `Godot Android Build Environment (GABE) "
"<https://godotengine.org/download/android/#gabe>`__ application on the same "
"device the Android editor is running on."
msgstr ""
"從 Godot 4.6 開始，可以直接在 Android 編輯器執行 Gradle 建置。這需要在執行 "
"Android 編輯器的同一裝置上安裝 `Godot Android Build Environment（GABE）"
"<https://godotengine.org/download/android/#gabe>`__ 應用程式。"

msgid ""
"This application is *not* required when exporting from the Android editor "
"with pre-built APK templates, or when exporting to other platforms."
msgstr ""
"當從支援預置 APK 範本的 Android 編輯器進行匯出，或向其他平台匯出時， *無需* "
"安裝此應用程式。"

msgid ""
"This application lets you install everything required to build Android "
"projects with Gradle. It is called by the Android editor to perform Gradle "
"builds when exporting to Android."
msgstr ""
"此應用程式可安裝透過 Gradle 建置 Android 專案所需的一切元件。Android 編輯器匯"
"出至 Android 時，會呼叫它進行 Gradle 建置。"

msgid ""
"To set up the build environment, open the app and follow these instructions:"
msgstr "如需設定建置環境，請打開應用程式並按照以下步驟操作："

msgid "Ensure you have an active Internet connection."
msgstr "請確保您擁有有效的互連網連接。"

msgid "Open the :menu:`Rootfs` tab from the bottom navigation bar."
msgstr "從底部導航欄中打開 :menu:`Rootfs` 分頁。"

msgid "Click :button:`Install Rootfs`."
msgstr "點擊 :button:`Install Rootfs` 。"

msgid ""
"After the installation completes, you can export projects using Gradle "
"builds from the Godot Android editor."
msgstr ""
"安裝完成後，就可以從 Godot Android 編輯器使用 Gradle 建置方式匯出專案。"

msgid "Enabling the Gradle build and exporting"
msgstr "啟用 Gradle 建置與匯出"

msgid ""
"When setting up the Android project in the **Project > Export** dialog, "
"**Gradle Build** needs to be enabled:"
msgstr ""
"在設定 Android 專案時，於 **專案 > 匯出** 對話框中，請啟用 **Gradle 建置**："

msgid ""
"From now on, attempting to export the project or one-click deploy will call "
"the Gradle build system to generate fresh templates. The templates built "
"will be used automatically afterwards, so no further configuration is needed."
msgstr ""
"從現在起，嘗試匯出專案或執行一鍵部署時，系統將呼叫 Gradle 建置系統來生成新的"
"範本。生成的範本將自動生效，因此無需進行任何額外設定。"

msgid ""
"When using the Gradle Android build system, assets that are placed within a "
"folder whose name begins with an underscore will not be included in the "
"generated APK. This does not apply to assets whose *file* name begins with "
"an underscore."
msgstr ""
"在使用 Gradle Android 建置系統時，置於名稱以底線開頭的資料夾中的資源將不會被"
"包含在生成的 APK 檔案中；但此規則不適用於 *檔案* 名本身以底線開頭的資源。"

msgid ""
"For example, ``_example/image.png`` will **not** be included as an asset, "
"but ``_image.png`` will."
msgstr ""
"例如，``_example/image.png`` 將 **不會** 包含為素材，但 ``_image.png`` 會。"
